            <title>[LU-21294] TCU: xattr/metadata calls on .Trash fail for a DNE striped parent directory</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21294</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;With TCU, deleted entries of a directory can be browsed under &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;dir&amp;gt;/.Trash&lt;/tt&gt;. When &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;dir&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt; is a DNE striped directory, any call that reads xattrs of the &lt;tt&gt;.Trash&lt;/tt&gt; root itself fails with ENOENT. The same calls succeed on a non-striped parent. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
